dumbtv home (fork) - third-party notices for the visual layers

Drawn by code in this repository (no files, nothing to attribute):
  Stage, Scenes, Landmarks, Variety, Journey - side speakers, theme vignettes (money, love, street,
  party, grief, faith, ocean, fire, city, space), city silhouettes and routes. All shapes are
  procedural Canvas paths. They contain no logos, team marks, brand art, real currency detail or text
  on buildings. Lottie and Konfetti were not needed and are not included.

Bundled assets:
  Butterchurn (MIT) and butterchurn-presets (MIT) - assets/butterchurn.min.js, assets/pre_*.json,
    licences in assets/LICENSE-butterchurn*.txt.

Data fetched at run time over the network (nothing is bundled, results are cached on the device):
  Wikidata (CC0 1.0) - hometown and landmark labels for artists without a hand-made route.
  MusicBrainz (core data CC0) - artist country, area and genre tags.
  LRCLIB (public lyrics API) - plain lyrics, matched against theme keywords on the device only;
    never displayed or redistributed.
